+#      generator choosing distinct disjoint color sets.
+#    - Each fillable hole lies clearly on one side of the midpoint: guaranteed by constrained
+#      placement using the same centroid test as the solver.
+#    - Adjacent non-bg color around a hole is dominated by the owning sprite border color:
